  "143": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "SCENE 3 — FILTER WITH WHERE\n\n<Picture 1> defines <Subject 1>. Preserve the same Prince character identity, clothing, proportions, face, bald head, half-lidded eyes, red-and-black checked shirt, dark trousers, and simplified hand-drawn anime appearance.\n\nRender the complete scene as simple nostalgic hand-drawn 2D Japanese family anime with thick clean black outlines, flat pastel colours, minimal cel shading, no realistic textures, no photorealism, no 3D graphics, and no mixed visual styles.\n\n0:00-0:03:\nContinue directly from the previous scene’s push toward the customer table.\n\nThe camera arrives at a full-screen view of one large illustrated table with exactly TWO columns:\n\nNAME\nCITY\n\nThe table contains exactly TEN customer rows in this exact order:\n\nAnna | Melbourne\nBen | Sydney\nCarlo | Melbourne\nDina | Brisbane\nEric | Adelaide\nFaye | Melbourne\nGeorge | Perth\nHannah | Melbourne\nIan | Sydney\nJulia | Melbourne\n\nAll ten names and city names must be clearly readable.\n\nA small version of <Subject 1> stands on the RIGHT side of the table, looking across all ten rows.\n\nHe raises one eyebrow and points toward the CITY column.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral Filipino Male Voice] But what if I only want customers from Melbourne?</d>\n\n0:03-0:06:\nA large flat hand-drawn funnel drops vertically from the top-centre of the screen.\n\nThe funnel is pastel yellow with a thick black outline.\n\nAcross the front of the funnel, exact bold uppercase text reads:\n\nWHERE\n\nAll ten customer rows move upward toward the funnel.\n\nThe rows for these exact customers are rejected and fly quickly off-screen to the LEFT:\n\nBen | Sydney\nDina | Brisbane\nEric | Adelaide\nGeorge | Perth\nIan | Sydney\n\nThe rows for these exact customers pass through the funnel and remain neatly stacked underneath it:\n\nAnna | Melbourne\nCarlo | Melbourne\nFaye | Melbourne\nHannah | Melbourne\nJulia | Melbourne\n\nExactly FIVE rows remain.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral Filipino Male Voice] WHERE filters the rows using a condition.</d>\n\n0:06-0:10:\nHard punch-in to the five remaining Melbourne rows.\n\nThe exact SQL query appears on the LEFT side of the screen in three clearly separated lines:\n\nSELECT name, city\nFROM customers\nWHERE city = 'Melbourne';\n\nThe third line:\n\nWHERE city = 'Melbourne';\n\nbriefly grows to exactly 130 percent of its original size with a sharp POP sound, then returns to normal size.\n\nAt the same time, each of the five remaining Melbourne city cells receives a small green check mark directly beside the word Melbourne.\n\nThe final visible rows remain exactly:\n\nAnna | Melbourne\nCarlo | Melbourne\nFaye | Melbourne\nHannah | Melbourne\nJulia | Melbourne\n\n<Subject 1> points directly at the WHERE line and says:\n<d>[English, Neutral Filipino Male Voice] Now SQL returns Anna, Carlo, Faye, Hannah, and Julia because their city is Melbourne.</d>\n\nAt the end of the scene, the five filtered rows slide together toward the RIGHT edge of the frame to transition into the next scene.\n\nHard cut."
    },
